cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below and cite
  the accompanying article when it is published.
type: software
title: >-
  Transient-glitch resilience in neural gravitational-wave parameter estimation
  without network retraining (glitch-robust-dingo-bns)
abstract: >-
  Preprocessing front-end that restores frozen DINGO-BNS posterior inference in
  the presence of short-duration transient glitches: STFT glitch detection,
  Tukey gating, matched-delta frequency-domain reconstruction, and retention of
  the original analysis ASDs. Includes the trained glitch detector, experiment
  drivers, and archived result summaries.
authors:
